    "GroupSerial" : 31152,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "To stand against the Black Dragon,\r\nthe Arisen needs the power of dragons.\r\nHowever, the Black Dragon has conquered\r\nother lands, and likely exceeds\r\nall other Dragons in strength.",
        "Jp" : "覚者が黒竜に立ち向かうには\r\nやはり竜の力が不可欠だ\r\n――だが、黒竜は他の大陸を侵攻し\r\nもはや他の竜を凌ぐ力を持っているだろう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 809016,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "So, is there no power in this world\r\nthat can oppose the Black Dragon?\r\nI refuse to believe that... \r\nI'm not ready to accept defeat.",
        "Jp" : "では、黒竜に対抗できる力は\r\nもうこの世に存在しないのか？\r\nそうは考えたくない――まだ諦めたくはない"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 814792,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If the Black Dragon rules all darkness,\r\nthen harnessing every Dragon's might\r\nmay be our only hope. No... it must be our\r\nsole focus.",
        "Jp" : "――黒竜が全ての闇を統べるというのなら\r\n全ての竜で対抗すれば望みがあるのではないか\r\nいや、全ての竜の力で対抗するよりほか\r\nないのではないか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 814793,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "This is my answer-\r\nthe ultimate aid I can provide\r\nis forging gear bearing dragon power\r\nand continuously enhancing it.",
        "Jp" : "これがオレの答えだ\r\n――つまり、オレにできる最大の協力は\r\n竜の力の宿った武具を合成し\r\nよりその力を高めていくことだと考えたわけだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 814794,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Therefore, I want you to collect\r\nequipment that holds dragon power.\r\nDon't discard or sell them by mistake. Be sure\r\nto handle them with care when disassembling.",
        "Jp" : "だから、竜の力の宿った武具を集めておいてほしい\r\n間違っても捨てたり売ったりしないようにな\r\n分解する時も気を付けてくれ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 817270,
      "MsgType" : 0,
